From d94b9a763103274afe8268a80dee26707ba49f85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nandakishore S <nans@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 05:53:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] IPPT changes for Utopia: This patch implements IP Pass-through (IPPT) functionality within the Utopia framework, supporting both NAT and non-NAT operation modes. It updates firewall logic to bypass standard restrictions and modifies DHCP services to propagate WAN IP and DNS settings directly to designated LAN clients

Signed-off-by: Nandakishore S <nans@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 source/firewall/firewall.c                    |  45 +++++--
 .../dhcp_server_functions.sh                  |  96 +++++++++++++--
 source/scripts/init/service.d/service_lan.sh  | 112 +++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 214 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)

